# The Big 3 kickflip with four NPC skaters in the park: exactly the same run (they ride on their own
# random stream and never touch the player).
park soma
cmd 0 npc spawn
spawn big3
hold up 0..100
hold ollie 166..196
tap flip+left 202
run 420
expect event pop{charge=1} within 195..198
expect event trickEnd{trick=Kickflip} within 240..260
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + BIG 3 GAP,multiplier=2} within 300..360
expect event gap{gap=BIG 3 GAP} within 320..340
expect skater.pos.x > 21.2 at end
expect no event bail
